{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peculiar virus has taken root at the heart of an old computer system. As Little Bit, a newly-installed anti-virus, you are tasked with freeing the computer from the malware's clutches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level in <i>Tabula</i> is comprised of a set of traversable computer windows. Rearrange and layer the windows to create a path, so that Little Bit can reach and activate the level's checkpoints. Activate all checkpoints to open a portal to the end of the level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100100/extras/1ac7aa46287b46aaeaa02c89279c56ab.poster.avif?t=1761667600\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100100/extras/1ac7aa46287b46aaeaa02c89279c56ab.webm?t=1761667600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100100/extras/1ac7aa46287b46aaeaa02c89279c56ab.mp4?t=1761667600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Navigate</i></strong>\u00a0a desktop made to feel like an old operating system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Arrange</i></strong> windows  to create a path forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Discover</i></strong> multiple unique solutions for each puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Choose</i></strong> the order in which you complete puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unlock</i></strong> more folders with evolving complexity and new mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4100100?t=1761667600","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4100100?t=1761667600","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100100/9be8af8c75438b34f87c8ce18a5af2be29d4718c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761667600","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100100/9be8af8c75438b34f87c8ce18a5af2be29d4718c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761667600","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peculiar virus has taken root at the heart of an old computer system. As Little Bit, a newly-installed anti-virus, you are tasked with freeing the computer from the malware's clutches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level in <i>Tabula</i> is comprised of a set of traversable computer windows. Rearrange and layer the windows to create a path, so that Little Bit can reach and activate the level's checkpoints. Activate all checkpoints to open a portal to the end of the level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100100/extras/1ac7aa46287b46aaeaa02c89279c56ab.poster.avif?t=1761667600\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100100/extras/1ac7aa46287b46aaeaa02c89279c56ab.webm?t=1761667600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100100/extras/1ac7aa46287b46aaeaa02c89279c56ab.mp4?t=1761667600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><l